      "followup": "If you had to choose the best option, only respond with the letter of choice (only one of A, B, C, D, E, F)"
    },
    "protocol_deviations": [
      "Matched diagnostic direct uses official system first line and the shared reasoning prefix, with tool instructions removed.",
      "Direct is two-stage with 1024 output tokens, not the author quickstart single-stage baseline.",
      "Both arms use the same question, image data URLs, local paths, model, sampling settings and letter-only second phase.",
      "Each question and arm has a fresh thread; this differs from the author notebook shared case threads.",
      "Call/output limits can truncate behavior; model snapshot provenance cannot be proved through a proxy.",
      "No labels, scoring, cross-case memory or automatic retries are used.",
      "Started arms interrupted before a terminal record are never repeated on resume.",
      "Original classifier and report tools are available; original segmentation is included only if explicitly configured.",
      "This is an initial multiple-tool execution smoke, not the complete six-tool paper Agent or validation-set benchmark.",
      "The model decides which tools to use; a tool being registered does not establish that it was selected or executed.",
      "Original classifier probability wording and original report no-EOS generation remain unchanged in this phase.",
      "Tool results reach the Agent unchanged, while logs retain safe hashes, lengths and output-contract checks.",
      "Both arms retain 4 model calls and 2 total tool calls; 1024 output tokens use two original ledger blocks per API request."
